  "action": "Action",
  "appDescriptionLong": "TwigaMoney is a personal finance management & budgeting app that helps you track your money use. This powerful spending tracker saves your money as you can see where your Money goes. It has daily expense tracker, free budget planner, intuitive analysis and many powerful features everything is offline, no internet needed.\n\nUse it for some days and you will see the differences.\n\nHow to manage Money and track expenses? Just add an expense record when you are spending some. TwigaMoney will take care of it. TwigaMoney is your ultimate budget planner that helps you achieve your budget goals. Too much spending on coffee? Set a budget on coffee and surely, you would not cross the budget target. This limits your expenses and helps you control your spending behaviour. If you really want to save Money and understand your expenses, TwigaMoney is the perfect app that can help you.",
  "keyFeatures": "Key Features",
  "featuresDetail": "Organizing your expenses allows you to have better control over your money.\n\n• Expense Manager\nTrack your income and expenses, classify them by category. Create categories as many as you need. You can modify or delete the records that you have created.\n\n• Budget Planner\nPlan monthly budget to boost savings. Try not to cross your budget target.\n\n• Effective Analysis & Graphical Reports\nSee your monthly income and expense analysis with clean charts. Create graphical reports.\n\n• Recurring Transactions\nSchedule recurring records, so the application automatically adds repetitive movements in fixed periods.\n\n• Quick Homescreen Widget\nTwigaMoney's smart homescreen widget helps you keep an eye on your balance and add records on the go, with a monthly summary widget.\n\n• Periodic Reports\nThe application shows reports grouped by periods along with your balance period. Available reports: daily, weekly, biweekly, monthly and yearly.\n\n• Simple & Easy\nIts simple and easy to use interface will surely make you love it.\n\n• Offline\nFully offline, no internet required to use TwigaMoney.\n\n• Wallet, Cards Separately\nMultiple accounts for managing wallet, cards, savings etc. No limitation on account creation.\n\n• Personal\nChoose the currency format and the date format used in your country. Select preferred category & account icons, titles.\n\n• Tablet Support\nHorizontal screen layout optimized for tablets.\n\n• Safe & Secured\nThe application lets you create a backup of your database to restore your information if necessary. Keep your record data safe with backups. Restore them if necessary. Export worksheets to print the records.\n\n💰 TRACK EVERYTHING\nTrack your expenses, income, savings, investments, and net worth in one place.\nVisualize your cash flow with clean, easy charts.\n\n📊 BUDGET WITH CONFIDENCE\nSet monthly budgets, control your spending, and stay on top of your financial goals.\nNo more end-of-month surprises.\n\n🔮 PLAN YOUR FUTURE\nUse smart tools to plan ahead:\nEmergency Fund Calculator – Know how long your money will last\nGoal Tracker – See exactly when you'll reach savings targets\nRetirement Planner – Find your financial freedom date\n\n📈 GROW YOUR WEALTH\nTrack stocks, crypto, and investments effortlessly.\nYour complete portfolio, in your pocket.\n\n🔒 100% PRIVATE\nNo logins\nNo cloud\nNo tracking\nEverything stays on your device.\n\n⚙️ BUILT FOR YOU\nCustom categories, icons & themes.\nMulti-currency support.\nSimple import & export.\nWorks fully offline.",
